{"id":"995dd9138f5c3e5a","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-omega-provability.md","title":"Omega Provability and Its Predicate","display":"df-omega-provability — Omega Provability and Its Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-omega-provability","aliases":["89-df-omega-provability"],"display":"df-omega-provability — Omega Provability and Its Predicate","depends_on":["[[89-df-omega-consistency]]","[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-omega-provability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-omega-provability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-provability — Omega Provability and Its Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f367207d33b1e75f\" href=\"?note=f367207d33b1e75f\" title=\"89-df-omega-consistency\">89-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8811191242063297\" href=\"?note=8811191242063297\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-semantics\">89-df-arithmetical-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S=\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\neg S\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S=\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\neg S\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OneVar},\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{imp},\\mathsf{sub}\">\\(\\mathsf{OneVar},\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{imp},\\mathsf{sub}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a> 中指定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> 的数值操作。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Graph}(f)\">\\(\\mathsf{Graph}(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Arith}(R)\">\\(\\mathsf{Arith}(R)\\)</span> 取本书内部定义方程认证的算术图公式。下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,x,n,c,d,u\">\\(b,x,n,c,d,u\\)</span> 为彼此按需改名的算术变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 使用同一语法编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则可证性的元谓词，不是分析中的完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{WCon}(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Arith}(\\mathsf{OneVar})(b)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists c\\exists d\\bigl(\\mathsf{Graph}(\\mathsf{all})(b,c)\\land\n\\mathsf{Graph}(\\mathsf{imp})(c,x,d)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(d)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\exists u\\bigl(\\mathsf{Graph}(\\mathsf{sub})(b,n,u)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(u)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists b\\ \\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{WCon}(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Arith}(\\mathsf{OneVar})(b)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists c\\exists d\\bigl(\\mathsf{Graph}(\\mathsf{all})(b,c)\\land\n\\mathsf{Graph}(\\mathsf{imp})(c,x,d)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(d)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\exists u\\bigl(\\mathsf{Graph}(\\mathsf{sub})(b,n,u)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(u)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists b\\ \\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 188–191；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n等价性是原书 Theorem 1：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg S\">\\(\\neg S\\)</span> 使理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 不一致，等价于存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x)\">\\(B(x)\\)</span>，PA 逐个证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\bar n)\">\\(B(\\bar n)\\)</span> 且证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xB\\to S\">\\(\\forall xB\\to S\\)</span>；即一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则足够。将有限多个此类应用合并成一个合取公式，仍可归并到一次；这不同于允许任意深度的完整闭包。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}\\)</span> 可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}\\)</span> 可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_3\">\\(\\Sigma_3\\)</span>。因此把它当作完整 PA <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则可证性（恰为标准算术真）会错误地产生一个算术真谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"f367207d33b1e75f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":""